        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "FRIDAY DECEMBER 31  First Night  Cotton Building  Downtown Port Townsend, WA  3 pm - 9 pm  Admission by Suggested Donation: $10 per person or $20 per family. No one turned away for lack of funds!    Harmonica Pocket @ 3 pm    An all-ages New Year's Eve extravaganza, celebrating light, music, and forward momentum! Full schedule of events includes Jugglers, Lantern Decorating and Parade, Discovery Bay Wild Bird Rescue, and live music by The Harmonica Pocket. More info here.    Presented by The Production Alliance and the Jefferson County Historical Society.    YES - Masks Required for Indoor Venues  NO - Proof of Vaccination Required"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "First Night — New Year’s Eve in Port Townsend"
      }
    ],
