      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&nbsp;    SUNDAY AUGUST 7  Departure Festival  Lake Leland Amphitheater  Quilcene, WA 98376  Advance Tickets available here    This year's Departure Fest NW will be held August 5, 6 &amp; 7, 2022 on the beautiful Olympic Peninsula at Lake Leland Amphitheater. As the world awakens from the darkness of the global pandemic, many are looking to gather and share in the joy of live music.      Bands include:      Wookiefoot    Dustin Thomas    Raye Zaragoza    Tim Snider &amp; Wolfgang Timber    The Shift    Hot Damn Scandal    Torin Frost &amp; Patterns of Saturn    Johnny Moses    Global Heat    Just Wright    River City Roots    Harmonica Pocket    &nbsp;"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
