    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SATURDAY AUGUST 26  Thing Festival  Sound Cave Project: Resonance Roadshow  thingnw.org/awesome-things    On the Resonance Roadshow stage in the Thing Market  (on the Parade Grounds between the two main stages)    • All-ages, family-friendly!  • No ticket required for this set!  • Harmonica Pocket at 3 pm    I will be playing an all-ages set on the incredible Sound Cave stage. Dreamed up and created by Tyson Ayers and the Sound Cave Project, this is an interactive musical sculpture with over 2500 tuned strings. You have to see, and hear and touch and play to believe. Come play!    Look for the Resonance Roadshow stage on the Parade Grounds between the two main stages. No tickets required for this set!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Thing Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
