        "@value": "SATURDAY DECEMBER 16  Mount Baker Community Club  mountbaker.org  2811 Mount Rainier Drive South  Seattle, WA 98144  Doors 10 am, Show 10:30 am    • Advance tickets for this show: bpt.me/6188168  • Advance tickets for all 7 shows in this series: bpt.me/6175269     This show is #2 in a series of 7 shows.  Here is the full series schedule:  December 2 Brian Vogan and His Good Buddies  December 16 Harmonica Pocket  December 30 SaulPaul  January 13 Johnny Bregar  January 27 Eli Rosenblatt  February 10 The Not-Its!  February 24 Paul Cheyokten Wagner"
