    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SATURDAY APRIL 20  Five Acre Barn Dance  Clallam County Fairgrounds  1608 W 16th St, Port Angeles, WA 98363  thebarndance.org    2:00 pm: Doors, Kids Zone games and crafts, petting zoo and family photos.  3:00 pm: Harmonica Pocket (Songwriting Workshop to follow at approx 4:30 pm)  4:30 pm: Soundwaves  6:00 pm: Backwood Hucksters  7:30 pm: The Shift    Local food, local drinks, lotsa dancing! Kids twelve and under are free! There will be a pay what you can option at the gate.    Advance Tickets: thebarndance.org/tickets"
      }
    ],
