    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SUNDAY JUNE 2  The Fauntleroy Schoolhouse  fauntleroyschoolhouse.org  9131 California Ave SW  Seattle, WA 98136  Doors @ 10, Show @ 10:30 am    Full Series Advance Tickets: brownpapertickets.com/event/6233116  Advance Tickets for 6/2 Harmonica Pocket show: brownpapertickets.com/event/6257106    This show is part of a 7 show family music series in West Seattle.  We will be sharing the stage with...    March 24th - Brian Vogan and his Good Buddies  April 7th - Eli Rosenblatt  April 21st - The Highlight Quartet  May 5th - Johnny Bregar  May 19th - Paul Chiyokten Wagner  June 2nd - The Harmonica Pocket  June 16th - The Not-Its!"
      }
    ],
