      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://harmonicapocket.com/events/songwriting-workshop-la-conner-wa/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "TUESDAY AUGUST 20  Songwriting Workshop @ La Conner Swinomish Library  laconnerswinomishlibrary.org  520 Morris Street  La Conner, WA 98257  10 am - 4:30 pm      More info about this event....    This will be a 6 hour creative songwriting workshop called How to Write a Rock Song.    In this unique creative writing workshop, anyone and everyone is a songwriter. Facilitated by professional songwriter Keeth Apgar, we discuss musical concepts including rhythm, melody and harmony. As we dig into the creative process we also touch upon the role of vowel sounds; play with creating images with words; dip into music theory and develop listening skills. We strategize about what to do when we get stuck and how to finish songs.    This is a folk art process, blending storytelling with songwriting. All voices are valued and included, without regard to formal musical training or prior experience.    Beginning through advanced music students are welcome. "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Songwriting Workshop (La Conner, WA)"
      }
    ],
