        "@id": "https://harmonicapocket.com/events/private-songwriting-music-homestead-retreat/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "I'll be hosting a student for a private songwriting and music retreat at my home studio near Port Townsend, WA.    Sample offerings are below.  Reach out to me via the Contact page if you would like more info about experiences like this.    Music Theory for Songwriters  Major keys  Minor keys  Chord inversions and voicings  Building chords (major, minor, extended)  Transposing for your own voice    Songwriting  Song feedback and critique  Co-writing sessions  Writing prompts  Arrangements    Guitar, Ukulele Lessons  Chord inversions up entirety of fretboard  Common (and uncommon!) chord progressions  Mapping pentatonicsImprovising solos  Playing in harmonic minor keys    Looping and Live Performance  Looping 101 and beyond using a variety of looping technologies, instruments and microphones     Recording Studio  Music production using on site Pro Tools rig"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Private Songwriting %26 Music Homestead Retreat"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
