    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SATURDAY JANUARY 25  TC Media  tcmedia.org  440 Yauger Way SW, Suite C  Olympia, WA    Doors 3:30 pm  Shows at 4 &amp; 5 pm    Advance Tickets: us.commitchange.com/tcmedia-studio-concert-harmonica-pocket    Today we will be taping a show at TCMedia -- a non-profit, community television studio in Olympia, Washington.    Proceeds from this concert support TCMedia's ongoing media education and community programming services as well as All Kids Win - a non-profit that provides weekend food to K-12 students in Thurston County."
