    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://harmonicapocket.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Calendar.20200903_SongwritingUkulele.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://harmonicapocket.com/events/rites-of-passage-songwriting-workshop/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://harmonicapocket.com/events/rites-of-passage-songwriting-workshop/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SUNDAY APRIL 27  Sing Your Song: A Creative Songwriting Experience for Brave Souls  Rite of Passage Journeys  riteofpassagejourneys.org  Bothell, WA  10 am - 5 pm    An intergenerational workshop open to everyone ages 13 and up. Sliding scale pricing info below.    &nbsp;  A little about this workshop:  You are a songwriter. Though you may not know it yet. Our everyday lives are so normal that we often overlook how exceptional we actually are.  In this unique creative songwriting workshop, we blend our stories, experiences and memories into original songs using highly personal images and symbols. Participants will uncover the jewels hidden in plain sight from very specific moments of their lives.  This is a folk art process, blending storytelling with songwriting. Through a reflective process we tell a little piece of our story using music and words.  Throughout this process you will be surrounded by fellow dreamers, risk-takers and like-minded creatives. We will spend a day together, talking, playing music and getting into a creative space.    Come write with me!  &nbsp;    This workshop is priced using a sliding scale — Everyone is in a different financial situation so this workshop is priced using a sliding scale. You are asked to use the honor system and pay at the highest level that you are able to afford.    $65-$295 Sliding Scale for youth (under 18)  $95-$295 Sliding Scale for adults (over 18)    Financial Aid is currently available."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Rite of Passage Songwriting Workshop"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventAttendanceMode": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode"
      }
    ]
  },
