        "@value": "THURSDAY JULY 17  Mount Si Metro Park  One Day Songwriting Camp - How to Write a Rock Song  daysmartrecreation.com/songwritingcamp2025    10 am - 5 pm    In this unique creative writing workshop, anyone and everyone is a songwriter. Together we co-create an original song from scratch based on participant-powered ideas. We discuss musical concepts including melody, lyrics and harmony."
