    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "TUESDAY SEPTEMBER 23  Snoqualmie Library  kcls.org/locations/snoqualmie  7824 Center Boulevard SE  Snoqualmie, WA 98065  5 - 7 pm    How to Write a Rock Song - In this unique creative writing workshop, anyone and everyone is a songwriter. Together we co-create an original song from scratch based on participant-powered ideas. We discuss musical concepts including melody, lyrics and harmony."
