    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SATURDAY NOVEMBER 15  Sumner Pierce County Library  mypcls.org/sumner-pierce-county-library  1116 Fryar Ave  Sumner, WA 98390  3 - 5 pm    How to Write a Rock Song - In this unique creative writing workshop, anyone and everyone is a songwriter. Together we co-create an original song from scratch based on participant-powered ideas. We discuss musical concepts including melody, lyrics and harmony."
      }
